        "TileImage": "$($repository 19dd4206-5386-4a88-9899-0e1bd46d2805).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening 47!\rYour targets are CIA operative Max Decker and his trusted friend and colleague Joseph Ducharme. Max is about to receive highly confidential information from an FSB asset Viktor Novikov who operates as double-agent. The FSB cannot let that happen, so they hired us to take out the CIA personnel who are about to take part in the deal. They will handle Novikov themselves. \rHappy hunting 47.",
